    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Ideally located in the well-established residential area of Oakpark, this bright and spacious three-bedroom semi-detached home is within easy reach of Tralee town centre, MTU Kerry and all local amenities.\r\nThe property boasts a well-proportioned and versatile layout, comprising a bright living room, generous kitchen with adjoining dining room, and a separate storage room. The dining room also offers excellent flexibility and could be adapted for use as an additional bedroom or home office, if required. Upstairs, there are three well-proportioned bedrooms and a family bathroom.\r\nThe property further benefits from a generous, private rear garden, providing excellent outdoor space and great potential for family living and entertaining.\r\nIts location, within easy walking distance of Tralee town centre, further enhances its appeal, making it an excellent choice for families, first-time buyers or those looking to downsize."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Porch - 2.2m x 0.7m \r\nTiled floor\r\n\r\nEntrance Hallway - 4.5m x 2.1m \r\nTiled floor, built in wardrobe\r\n\r\nLiving Room - 3.9m x 3.5m \r\nLaminate floor, open fire place      \r\n\r\nKitchen - 4.6m x 2.7m \r\nTiled floor, fitted kitchen with ground and eye level units\n                                               \n\r\n\r\nDining Room - 3.6m x 3.2m \r\nCarpeted floor\r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR - \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 3.9m x 2.9m \r\nCarpeted floor, built in wardrobe       \r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.5m x 3.2m \r\nCarpeted floor, built in wardrobe      \r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 2.9m x 2.6m \r\nCarpeted floor, built in wardrobe      \r\n\r\nBathroom - 1.6m x 1.5m \r\nFully tiled, shower, WHB, WC\r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Oil fired central heating\r\nPrivate and generous rear garden\r\nMains services\r\nDouble glazed PVC windows\r\nConvenient to all amenities"
      }
